<task id="040" project="email-communication-solution-r5">
  <metadata>
    <title>FR-01 / NFR-06: Assemble the single shared React 19 `EmailWorkspace` component (dual-mount source of truth)</title>
    <phase>4 Dual-use surface</phase>
    <gate>after:033,034,035,036</gate>
    <status>completed</status>
    <rigor>FULL</rigor>
    <rigor-reason>Composition root that both mounts (widget + code page) render — the load-bearing dual-mount parity contract (NFR-06). Modifies `.tsx`; composes all Phase-3 sub-views; a defect here propagates to both surfaces. FULL gate.</rigor-reason>
    <model-tier>sonnet</model-tier>
    <model-tier-reason>Assembly/composition of already-built Phase-3 sub-views into one component following the established Pattern D reference; no new architecture or security-critical logic. Sonnet @ high.</model-tier-reason>
    <effort>high</effort>
    <parallel-group>none</parallel-group>
    <parallel-safe>false</parallel-safe>
    <parallel-reason>This is the composition root both mounts (041 widget + 042 code page) consume; the sub-view tasks (033–036) all compose into it. Serialize — no concurrent edit of the shared `EmailWorkspace` surface.</parallel-reason>
    <deps>033,034,035,036</deps>
    <tags>frontend, fluent-ui</tags>
    <estimated-effort>4-6 hours</estimated-effort>
